  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Royal Society: Core and Resilient Futures - UK ODA Fellowships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fellowships for non-UK scientists who are at an early stage of their research career and wish to conduct research in the UK. (From the Resilient Futures Collective Fund).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supports UK and international researchers and innovators to take on key issues affecting developing countries through:
&#x2022; challenge-led multidisciplinary research
&#x2022; strengthening capability for research, innovation and knowledge exchange
&#x2022; providing an agile response to emergencies</narrative>
  </description>
